# Deny-all + allowlist. docker/spark-migrated/Dockerfile is the only image built
# from the repo root as its context, and it needs nothing but the all_spark
# migration chain and register_tables.py. Without this, the context would also
# ship actions-runner/ (~2.3G of self-hosted runner state), .git/, dist/ and
# .pants.d/ to the daemon on every build.
#
# docker/spark-connect uses its own subdirectory as context, so this file does
# not affect it.
*
!src/crutch_migrations/all_spark_migrations/**
!docker/spark-migrated/register_tables.py
